# EnvironmentPostProcessor is still registered through spring.factories in Spring Boot 3.x - the
# META-INF/spring/*.imports mechanism that replaced it in 2.7 covers AutoConfiguration only, and a
# post-processor listed there is silently ignored (no warning, no error, the aliases simply never
# appear). See BridgeMainPropertyAliases for what this one does.
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.demo.artio.boot.BridgeMainPropertyAliases
